[module addressbookdoc(_'http://www.eclipse.org/fennec/m2x/example/addressbook/1.0', _'http://www.eclipse.org/fennec/m2x/example/contact/1.0')/]
[comment]
The same model, generated as documentation instead of as data: nothing about the setup
changes between the two, only the template.
[/comment]
[template public main(book : AddressBook)]
[file ('addressbook.md', false)]
# Address book of [book.owner/]

[book.entries->size()/] entries.

[for (person : Person | book.entries)]
## [person.firstName/] [person.lastName/]

- Title: [person.title/]
- Organization: [person.organization/]
[for (email : Email | person.emails)]
- Email: [email.address/] ([email.kind/])
[/for]

[for (phone : Phone | person.phones)]
- Phone: [phone.number/]
[/for]

[for (address : Address | person.addresses)]
- Address: [address.city/], [address.country/]
[/for]


[/for]
[/file]
[/template]
